<view class="page-shell {{motionOff ? 'motion-off' : ''}}">
  <view class="ink-orb ink-orb--one"></view>
  <view class="page-content">
    <view class="eyebrow">第一步 · 情境</view>
    <view class="page-title">你想理清哪一类事？</view>
    <view class="page-subtitle">选择最接近的一项即可，后续分析会围绕现实条件展开。</view>

    <view class="category-list">
      <button
        wx:for="{{categories}}"
        wx:key="id"
        class="category-card pressable {{selected === item.id ? 'category-card--selected' : ''}}"
        data-category="{{item.id}}"
        disabled="{{navigating}}"
        bindtap="selectCategory"
      >
        <view class="category-card__mark">{{item.mark}}</view>
        <view class="category-card__body">
          <view class="category-card__top">
            <view class="category-card__title">{{item.title}}</view>
            <view class="category-card__arrow">→</view>
          </view>
          <view class="category-card__description">{{item.description}}</view>
          <view class="category-card__prompt">{{item.prompt}}</view>
        </view>
      </button>
    </view>

    <view class="toast-note">
      如果问题同时涉及多个领域，优先选择“你最需要采取行动”的那一项。
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
